{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16082","headline":"送从侄拟赴江陵少尹 · 王建","name":"送从侄拟赴江陵少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江陵少尹好闲官，亲故皆来劝自宽。\n无事日长贫不易，有才年少屈终难。\n沙头欲买红螺盏，渡口多呈白角盘。\n应向章华台下醉，莫冲云雨夜深寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}